# `whitemarket-official` is a (corporate) personal GitHub account, not an organization: it has no teams, so every
# rule names the account (SDK_SPEC 0). The PR author cannot approve their own PR, so `main` does not require a
# code-owner review; the human review of the paths below is the owner's check of the diff before the merge.
# This file is identical in all seven WhiteMarket SDK repositories (.claude/shared-docs.conf).

# Default owners
*                         @whitemarket-official

# Agent configuration is executable instructions for every future agent session:
# changes are reviewed by a human separately (CLAUDE.md, "Agent configuration is a security zone").
/CLAUDE.md                @whitemarket-official
/.claude/                 @whitemarket-official
/.mcp.json                @whitemarket-official

# Files shared byte-identical across the seven SDK repositories (.claude/shared-docs.conf)
/CODEOWNERS               @whitemarket-official
/docs/SDK_SPEC.md         @whitemarket-official
/docs/WHITEMARKET_API.md  @whitemarket-official

# CI and release pipelines, the build entry point and dev tools (they run on every contributor's machine and in CI)
/.github/                 @whitemarket-official
/Makefile                 @whitemarket-official
/tools/                   @whitemarket-official
